{
  "movie_id": 220800402,
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 8.5,
      "end_time": 9.5,
      "text": "Piyuu~~"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 10.1,
      "end_time": 12.4,
      "text": "Uh, piiii!?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 13.0,
      "end_time": 14.1,
      "text": "Ahhh!?"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 25.0,
      "end_time": 28.5,
      "text": "～♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 42.8,
      "end_time": 45.6,
      "text": "Oh, here comes Onii-san♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 58.6,
      "end_time": 59.4,
      "text": "...!?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 59.6,
      "end_time": 60.5,
      "text": "...!?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 61.2,
      "end_time": 62.2,
      "text": "Hmm?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 63.6,
      "end_time": 64.8,
      "text": "?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 65.3,
      "end_time": 68.3,
      "text": "Honestly, what's he doing?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 70.6,
      "end_time": 71.5,
      "text": "...!?"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 73.0,
      "end_time": 74.2,
      "text": "Korosuke?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 75.1,
      "end_time": 78.3,
      "text": "Ah, no... It seems to be my imagination."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 89.1,
      "end_time": 94.6,
      "text": "──Now then. As the one who called this meeting, if I may humbly speak."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 94.9,
      "end_time": 100.3,
      "text": "I, Nephi Nela would like to act as the facilitator"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 100.6,
      "end_time": 103.8,
      "text": "Would that be alright with you two?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 104.6,
      "end_time": 105.6,
      "text": "Yes☆"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 106.4,
      "end_time": 107.4,
      "text": "Indeed..."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 108.5,
      "end_time": 112.2,
      "text": "I am deeply honored."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 112.6,
      "end_time": 115.4,
      "text": "Princess Lyrael of Gio Teogonia"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 116.7,
      "end_time": 120.0,
      "text": "And Princess Pecorine of Landosol"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 122.5,
      "end_time": 128.5,
      "text": "I am deeply grateful to have you gathered here"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 131.2,
      "end_time": 132.6,
      "text": ".....If it were possible"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 132.9,
      "end_time": 135.3,
      "text": "Together with the princess of Gio Niflhel"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 135.9,
      "end_time": 139.5,
      "text": "I wished to have a\n'Four Worlds Conference', but──"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 140.6,
      "end_time": 141.6,
      "text": "...Yes."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 142.0,
      "end_time": 147.1,
      "text": "I would be honored if I could at least receive a seat at the end."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start_time": 147.3,
      "end_time": 147.9,
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start_time": 152.6,
      "end_time": 154.6,
      "text": "──Nice to meet you, everyone"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start_time": 155.3,
      "end_time": 158.5,
      "text": "I am the princess of Gio Niflhel──"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start_time": 158.9,
      "end_time": 161.2,
      "text": "My name is Violet"
    }
  ],
